      "t": "Давайте мы попробуем это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's try this.' — Notice the verb meaning 'let's (do it)' paired with the pronoun for 'we'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Жак, ты где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Jacques, where are you?' — Notice the noun meaning 'Jacques' paired with the pronoun for 'you'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Я здесь, я иду!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am here, I am coming!' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'I' paired with the adverb for 'here'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "А вы кто такой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And who are you?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'you' paired with the pronoun for 'who'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Он мой сосед.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is my neighbor.' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'he' paired with the det for 'my'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Представляешь, мы жили в Париже.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can you imagine, we lived in Paris.' — Notice the verb meaning 'can you imagine, believe' paired with the pronoun for 'we'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Подожди, мы не будем целоваться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, we are not going to kiss.' — Notice the verb meaning 'wait' paired with the pronoun for 'we'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сначала надо закусить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First we need to have a bite.' — Notice the adverb meaning 'first, at first' paired with the adverb for 'it is necessary'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "На, попробуй это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here, try this.' — Notice the verb meaning 'to try, to taste' paired with the pronoun for 'this'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Это очень вкусно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is very delicious.' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'this' paired with the adverb for 'very much'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Он говорит, что это вкусно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He says that it is delicious?' — Notice the pronoun meaning 'he' paired with the verb for 'talks'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, ему очень нравится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, he likes it very much.' — Notice the pronoun meaning '(to) him' paired with the adverb for 'very much'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Спасибо, мой дорогой друг.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
